SUMMARY:$Hot Cocoa & Flow: Kids Holiday Yoga (60m) - Claire
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Claire Larson\nRoom: OV Mind/Body Studio\nLoca
 tion: Ocotillo Village\nHot Cocoa & Flow: Kids Holiday Yoga\nSunday D
 ecember 20th | 10:00am-11am\n\nStep into a winter wonderland with Cla
 ire for a playful holiday yoga adventure! Kids will move\, stretch\, 
 and explore fun winter-themed poses and yoga games before cozying up 
 with friends for hot cocoa and a special holiday treat. Designed for 
 ages 5–10. Bring a yoga mat + water.\n\n$15 members / guest $35\nMi
 nd body studio\n\nPlease sign up on the Village App. No refunds for n
 o shows or cancellations within 36 hours\nEmail: Claire/ clarson@dmbc
 lubs.com
END:VEVENT
