DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Ericka Brian\nRoom: OV Lawn\nLocation: Ocotill
 o Village\nSunrise Meditation\n\nBegin each month with clarity and in
 tention. This guided sunrise meditation experience blends breathwork\
 , gentle grounding movement\, and intentional stillness to regulate t
 he nervous system and sharpen mental focus. As the sun rises\, you’
 ll reset your energy\, refine your vision\, and align your mindset fo
 r the month ahead.\nStart centered. Stay aligned.\n \nFree Members I 
 $35 guests\n\nFor more information\, please contact Ericka Brian | eb
 rian@dmbclubs.com\n\nPlease sign up on the Village App.
