DESCRIPTION:Instructor: James Cole\nRoom: OV Pickle East 1\, 2\; OV Pi
 ckle West 1\, 2\nLocation: Ocotillo Village\nPickleball at Ocotillo V
 illage.  Every Sunday\, Tuesday\, Wednesday\, Thursday and Friday eac
 h week. \n\nBe sure to take alook at the Basketball Court Schedule.  
 A sign is on display as you enter the Basketball Court and take home 
