  all player levels who want to have a fun\, socialize and recreationa
 l play.\n\nCertified Pickleball Coach\, James Cole will be providing 
 Coaching and Instruction for those who are needing or wanting some ex
 tra instruction or 1 on 1 Coaching.\n\nThe Basketball Court will not 
