 Open Play Times are over.\n\nPlay time is reserved for the first 20 t
 hat register on the Village Mobile App.  Registration opens 48 hours 
 prior to the day and time of the next scheduled Pickleball Open Play.
    Rules and Play Policy will be posted at the Court.\n\n*There will 
 be no Officials. Honesty and Good Sportsmanship will be expected at a
 ll times.
